# Custom recipe for WebKit2GTK 2.46.5 (GTK3 API 4.1; cmake)
#
# Part of the Pantheon stack port. The GTK 3 web engine, needed by
# PantheonMail 8.0.1: dependency('webkit2gtk-4.1') +
# dependency('webkit2gtk-web-extension-4.1'). This is the webkitgtk 2.46.5
# tarball built with -DUSE_GTK4=OFF, which yields the 4.1 API (soup3, so the
# 4.1 infix is correct, not 4.0).
#
# The SAME tarball is also built as WebKitGTK 2.46.5 (GTK4 API 6.0) for
# PantheonCapnetAssist; 2.46.x is a single-binary-per-port release (USE_GTK4 is
# an either/or public option), so two separate builds are required. Both install
# into distinct program trees (webkit2gtk-4.1.pc vs webkitgtk-6.0.pc), so they
# coexist on the index.
#
# Build environment: runs after GTK+ 3.24.43 (x11+wayland), GStreamer 1.26.1 +
# Gst-Plugins-Base (gstreamer components auto-detected), LibHyphen 2.8.8
# (FindHyphen via /usr -> Index), Unifdef 2.12 (find_program on PATH), LibIcal,
# libsoup3, gio, ICU, libseccomp, bubblewrap. GTK4-era extras (skia) unused;
# cairo path -> requires Fontconfig + Freetype (both on the ISO).
#
# Flags:
#  - USE_GTK4=OFF        -> 4.1 API (Mail); soup3 by default (USE_SOUP2 off).
#  - USE_GBM=OFF         -> libgbm.pc is not on the ISO (USE_LIBDRM stays ON,
#                           libdrm.pc is present).
#  - ENABLE_GAMEPAD=OFF  -> libmanette not on the ISO (default is already OFF).
#  - ENABLE_INTROSPECTION=OFF, ENABLE_DOCUMENTATION=OFF -> Mail only needs the
#    pcs; introspection would pull girepository-1.0/2.0 pc friction.
#  - ENABLE_MINIBROWSER=OFF (already default OFF).
#  - ENABLE_SPELLCHECK=OFF -> skip Enchant (OptionsGTK.cmake:373 FATAL_ERROR
#    "Enchant is needed for ENABLE_SPELLCHECK"; enchant-2 not on the ISO and no
#    consumer in the stack uses webkit spellcheck).
#  - USE_JPEGXL=OFF, USE_AVIF=OFF, USE_WOFF2=OFF, USE_LIBBACKTRACE=OFF ->
#    skip libjxl/libavif/libwoff2dec/libbacktrace (none on the ISO; all four
#    default PUBLIC ON and FATAL_ERROR when the pc is missing).
#  - ENABLE_PDFJS=OFF -> WebKit downloads pdf.js at build time when it is not
#    bundled in the tarball (no ThirdParty/ dir); the chroot is offline.
#    USE_LCMS stays ON (LCMS2 present); ENABLE_JOURNALD_LOG stays ON
#    (libelogind.pc present); ENABLE_BUBBLEWRAP_SANDBOX stays ON (bwrap 0.11.0
#    present, runtime-only check).
#  - USE_GSTREAMER_TRANSCODER=OFF -> gst-transcoder (separate project from core
#    GStreamer; gstreamer-transcoder-1.0.pc not on the ISO). GStreamerChecks
#    fatals when ENABLE_MEDIA_RECORDER (ON) + USE_GSTREAMER_TRANSCODER (ON) +
#    pc missing. MediaRecorder's only real GTK impl is behind this flag, so the
#    feature is effectively inert without it. ENABLE_WEB_RTC stays OFF
#    (defaults to ENABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_FEATURES=OFF) so gstreamer-webrtc (from
#    gst-plugins-bad, not built) is never probed.
#  - X11 + Wayland targets stay ON (GTK+ rebuild supports both).
#
# file_md5 + file_size verified against the webkitgtk.org release tarball.

compile_version=017-GIT
url="https://webkitgtk.org/releases/webkitgtk-2.46.5.tar.xz"
file_size=42898600
file_md5=095d7f72acb300839c9879a4f95bf941
dir='webkitgtk-2.46.5'
recipe_type=cmake

cmake_options=(
    -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
    -DPORT=GTK
    -DUSE_GTK4=OFF
    -DUSE_GBM=OFF
    -DENABLE_GAMEPAD=OFF
    -DENABLE_INTROSPECTION=OFF
    -DENABLE_DOCUMENTATION=OFF
    -DENABLE_MINIBROWSER=OFF
    -DENABLE_SPELLCHECK=OFF
    -DENABLE_PDFJS=OFF
    -DUSE_JPEGXL=OFF
    -DUSE_AVIF=OFF
    -DUSE_WOFF2=OFF
    -DUSE_LIBBACKTRACE=OFF
    -DUSE_GSTREAMER_TRANSCODER=OFF
)
